  "caveats": [
    "Disk: Standard SSD E10 (128 GiB) = $9.60/month -> $0.075/GiB-month; Windows OS disks default to 127 GiB and are billed per provisioned tier even when deallocated. Premium SSD P10 = $19.71/month.",
    "Snapshots: $0.05/GB-month on Standard HDD storage; $0.132/GB-month if kept on SSD.",
    "Egress: first 100 GB/month free, then $0.087/GB (Microsoft network routing, first 10 TB); $0.08/GB with Internet routing preference.",
    "IPv4: Standard static public IP $0.005/h = $3.65/month.",
    "Azure Hybrid Benefit (BYO licence) removes the Windows surcharge; reservations / savings plan / Spot not encoded.",
    "Free account: $200 credit for 30 days (encoded as one_time_credit) and 750 h/month of B2ts/B2pts/B2ats v2 for 12 months (not encoded).",
    "Windows Server only; Windows 11 client needs AVD multi-session or Windows 365."
  ],
